BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_102ea13b-a309-3dc1-8ec4-cb6af7703e08.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
